Two proof angles selected
angle_1=residual_route_triples: Q/covering/K33 and C27/K33/F7 must center at a named residual router
angle_2=guardrail_sidecar_triples: Moser/Toeplitz/Roth carriers must center at a sidecar hub before route choice

Next theorem target
For every HYP-2963 coarse fiber, every route/status-changing triple should either:
  (a) have a unique median center after the listed sidecars are attached;
  (b) expose the first missing sidecar coordinate; or
  (c) route to AP/GW boundary, Q-witness deck, owner-strip descent, harmonic certificate, or named F7/THM-572 debt.
